# Conformance probe pack used as an inner pack: a list of texts read through a
# table that has an entry for 1 only (spec 0.34 ruling 21). Public. No kinds.
format     conformance-inner-vianames
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
map     tags  1  one
group   probe.names rest
  field  probe.tag  8  uint  via tags
end
